color
none

=== hash-exists-key-method
from: IO::Socket::SSL 0.0.4 lib/IO/Socket/SSL.rakumod:56
license: MIT
feature: method EXISTS-KEY
--- code
my %args = listen => 1, listening => 1;
%args<listening> .= Bool if %args.EXISTS-KEY('listen');
say %args<listening>.raku;
say %args.EXISTS-KEY('nope');
--- expect
Bool::True
False

=== hash-exists-key-subset
from: DateTime::TimeZone 0.10.2 lib/DateTime/TimeZone.rakumod:601
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: decl subset
--- code
my %timezones = UTC => 0, CET => 1;
my subset IsTimeZone of Str:D where { %timezones.EXISTS-KEY($_) };
say 'CET' ~~ IsTimeZone;
say 'XYZ' ~~ IsTimeZone;
--- expect
True
False

